66.12, "end": 71.96, "text": "The rails remain — the story's not in vain"}, {"start": 71.96, "end": 78.52000000000001, "text": "The wheel turns on, again and again"}, {"start": 81.04, "end": 86.87, "text": "The city lights of Pyongyang far behind"}, {"start": 86.87, "end": 90.64, "text": "A flying car, an AI, a fractured timeline"}, {"start": 90.64, "end": 95.63, "text": "I packed my bags with things I couldn't name"}, {"start": 95.63, "end": 101.62, "text": "Fried chicken, soju, and a child's shame"}, {"start": 101.62, "end": 106.96, "text": "The dashboard showed a map of what was lost"}, {"start": 106.96, "end": 111.6, "text": "Every station, every bridge, every crossing crossed"}, {"start": 111.6, "end": 117.41, "text": "My grandfather's handbook on the passenger seat"}, {"start": 117.41, "end": 122.9, "text": "A faded note: \"For Biaohan — keep the beat\""}, {"start": 125.7, "end": 131.46, "text": "The rails remain — they're calling out your name"}, {"start": 131.79999999999998, "end": 137.38, "text": "Through every storm, through every field of grain"}, {"start": 137.38, "end": 143.08, "text": "The rails remain — the story's not in vain"}, {"start": 143.08, "end": 149.18, "text": "The wheel turns on, again and again"}, {"start": 157.54, "end": 163.32, "text": "I don't know if I can do this alone"}, {"start": 164.35999999999999, "end": 170.44, "text": "But the iron doesn't lie, and the ties don't break"}, {"start": 170.44, "end": 176.3, "text": "When you're standing on the shoulders of the ones who came before"}, {"start": 176.3, "end": 178.78, "text": "They're still here"}, {"start": 181.38, "end": 184.14000000000001, "text": "Waiting at the door"}, {"start": 205.14, "end": 211.41, "text": "The rails remain — they're calling out your name"}, {"start": 211.41, "end": 217.72, "text": "Through every storm, through every field of grain"}, {"start": 217.72, "end": 223.12, "text": "The rails remain — the story's not in vain"}, {"start": 223.12, "end": 230.16, "text":